# Driver - Compiler Driver Implementation
#
# This module contains the main compiler driver implementation:
# - CheckBackendImpl: Backend for type checking only
# - CompilerDriver: Main compiler orchestration (class + phases 1-4)
#
# Extracted modules:
# - driver_log_helpers.spl: Logging helpers
# - driver_bootstrap.spl: Bootstrap compilation functions
# - driver_source_loading.spl: Source collection + error formatting
# - driver_pipeline.spl: JIT/SMF/borrow/async/optimize/AOP/debug methods
# - driver_aot_output.spl: AOT output methods
# - driver_types.spl: Type definitions
# - driver_api.spl: Convenience API functions

